OL,1,V7w3s7s35B                        G10/26
OL,2,V55555555CSCHOOLS: BID TO END
OL,3,Vu5u5u5u5CSCOTTISH DISPUTE
OL,4,B
OL,5, The Government is setting up an
OL,6, independent committee of inquiry in a
OL,7, bid to settle the Scottish teachers'
OL,8, pay dispute.
OL,10, Scottish Secretary Malcolm Rifkind
OL,11, told the Commons that the committee
OL,12, would take evidence from "all
OL,13, interested parties".
OL,15, He said: "It will give the teachers the
OL,16, independent hearing which they have
OL,17, asked for since the beginning of the
OL,18, dispute."
OL,20, He urged the unions to call off their
OL,21, action and let schools return to normal
OL,23,F]DFrom 06-03-96 / teletextarchive.com
OL,24,ANext PageBT'text FilesCRewindFReg Radio
